<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian June wholesale prices rise 0.1 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Austrian June wholesale prices rise 0.1 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following provisional economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION		JUNE	 MAY	 JUNE 96</p>
<p> Monthly WPI index change	0.1	 -0.1	   -1.0</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr index change	   0.1	 -0.5	   -1.3</p>
<p> Index			     100.5	100.4	  104.3</p>
<p>NOTES -- The June and May 1997 index figures are based on 1996=100, while the June 1996 figure is based on 1986=100.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
</text>
